      "objective": "Preserve private Chronicle ownership, capability-scoped workspace entry, existing authoring and live-Voyage boundaries through the expanded shared content models.",
      "visibleOutcome": "The same owner reaches Creator, previews four Chronicle creation intentions without creating a record, returns to the library, then opens Captain and Player through All Workspaces without granting access to another owner private content.",
      "integrationOwner": "Existing Parallax integration owner #776; Homeport, Chronicle, Landfall and One Voyage retain their separate workspace, publication and live-session authorities.",
      "accessibility": "Use the actual account disclosure, semantic workspace cards, named Chronicle creation choices with unavailable choices identified, and pressed-state tabs on desktop and phone in both motion modes.",
      "fallback": "Preserve actual sign-in redirects, permission-required states, private-resource 404, empty libraries and active-Chronicle transition locks.",
      "navigation": "All Workspaces → Creator Library → Create Chronicle choices → Your Chronicles → All Workspaces → Captain → Player → All Workspaces.",
      "designTarget": "Preserve the current three workspace task compositions and the accepted shared Homeport identity and navigation hierarchy.",
